I have proposed a Wireless Networking micro-conference for Linux 
Plumbers Conference 2014 taking place on October 15-17 in Düsseldorf,
Germany.  I hope it will cover topics covering 802.11, Bluetooth,
NFC, and other related technologies.

The wiki page for the proposal is here:

	http://wiki.linuxplumbersconf.org/2014:network_wireless

